  "description": "YAQJAB01 crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H115 Eu5 O25. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.609-5.198 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.96-159.37°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H115Eu5O25. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
